{"key":"t65-bio-x3","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"The frequency of alleles for dark color increases in the population.","working":"Dark beetles are better camouflaged on darkened bark, so birds eat fewer dark beetles than light beetles. Because color is heritable, dark beetles survive and reproduce more, passing on their alleles. Over many generations, natural selection increases the frequency of alleles for dark color. Choice A is wrong because individual light beetles do not heritably change color. Choice C ignores differential survival. Choice D is wrong because bird evolution would not occur within one generation and is not the direct outcome described.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":465,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":81,"cacheReadTokens":384},"outputTokens":359,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":137,"reasoningTokens":222},"totalTokens":824,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":465,"completion_tokens":359,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":81,"total_tokens":824,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":222}},"reasoningTokens":222,"cachedInputTokens":384},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":5001,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"t65-bio-x3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"The frequency of alleles for dark color increases in the population.","working":"Natural selection acts on heritable variation in a population. Because the tree bark darkened, dark-colored beetles have a camouflage advantage against bird predation compared to light-colored beetles. Consequently, dark-colored beetles survive at higher rates and produce more offspring. Over many generations, this differential reproductive success leads to an increase in the frequency of alleles conferring dark coloration in the beetle population.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":413,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":413,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":365,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":120,"reasoningTokens":245},"totalTokens":778,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":245,"promptTokenCount":413,"candidatesTokenCount":120,"totalTokenCount":778,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":413}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":120}]},"reasoningTokens":245,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4937,"keyed_label":"B"}
